                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "8 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "\"The signature steamed grouper immediately caught everyone\u0027s attention as soon as it was served. The fish body was crystal clear, and the aroma was overflowing after being poured with hot oil. The fish meat was tender and smooth, with a firm texture and a hint of sweetness. Combined with the fragrant scallions, ginger and soy sauce, it fully demonstrates the essence of Cantonese cuisine: \"clear but not bland, fresh but not greasy.\" This dish is not only a feast for the taste buds, but also a must-order dish at the banquet, which symbolizes good luck.\" \"The shrimp dumplings are crystal clear and the shrimp are chewy; the siu mai are plump and solid, with fragrant meat and fresh shrimp; the radish cake is crispy on the outside and tender on the inside, with a savory and fragrant aftertaste. These three classic Cantonese dim sum, every bite is authentic and satisfying!\" With such a high level of ingredients and environment, the price is super value and it is very suitable for family gatherings or entertaining friends!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "「招牌蒸龍虎斑一上桌，立刻吸引全場目光。魚身晶瑩剔透，澆上熱油後香氣四溢。魚肉鮮嫩細滑，口感緊實又帶著絲絲甜味，配合清香的蔥薑與醬油，完全展現粵菜『清而不淡、鮮而不膩』的精髓。這道菜既是味蕾享受，也是宴席上寓意吉祥的必點佳餚。」「蝦餃晶瑩剔透、鮮蝦彈牙；燒賣飽滿紮實、肉香蝦鮮；蘿蔔糕外酥內嫩、鹹香回味。三款經典粵式點心，每一口都道地又滿足！」以這樣的食材水準和環境，價格超值很適合家庭聚餐或宴請朋友！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
